Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you can avoid drinking \Nit, I'd prefer you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind you being an undead forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:17.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Just stay here forever and spend \Nyour life as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:20.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.25,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But that's not what you want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:28.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even if you don't have the talent, \Neven if it takes you years...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:31.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You want to become one \Nno matter what, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:34.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A Mythril-class adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you haven't \Nalready made your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.36,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,This has been your dream \Nfor years, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:46.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:47.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:51.76,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:57.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I just remembered something Sheila asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:00:58.93,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What did she ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:00.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now that you've said that, I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Really worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:11.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:14.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, but if you don't \Nwant to answer, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You know everything about \Nme there is to know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:19.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:21.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's a ton I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:32.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, why did you decide to become \Na Mythril-class adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:09.00,Title,{Episode 12,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H343232&\3c&H646D76&\b1\pos(203.232,277.724)}Rentt\NFaina
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:11.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I never told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:18.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've known you for long enough that \NI kind of expected that answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.05,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.88,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Just drink the blood of \Na vampire, or a troll,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:25.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,or whatever you want, and evolve already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's kind of mean, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:31.48,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,"It's wrong to ask an adventurer \Nabout their identity or past."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,"That's the unspoken rule of this job."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:38.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me \Nthat all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:42.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Of course, I can't imagine you having \Nany kind of dark secret in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:45.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But after you told me that, \NI couldn't exactly ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It just never came up, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's not that interesting a story, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:03.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, that's not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:10.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I wanted to become a person who could \Nstop a tragedy from ever happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The village where I was \Nborn, Hathala Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,was nestled deep in the mountains \Nfar away from any city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:23.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,My dad did the shopping for the whole village, \Nand anything else that required going outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:28.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was five the first time my \Nparents took me outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.61,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Hey, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.84,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,What, Jinlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:38.07,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,What do you think the town's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:41.17,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's lots of \Nstuff we've never seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:42.58,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.94,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's a lot of people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:49.85,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm scared of bandits and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.97,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,You're such a wimp, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:53.13,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,If you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:58.36,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,If you're that wimpy you'll never \Nbe able to become an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.26,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:00.98,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.66,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Don't let your parents hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.99,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:09.48,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,I want to travel the world when I grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:12.10,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Waterfalls falling from islands \Nfloating in the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.87,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Towns surrounded by water...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.70,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Castles that disappear like a mirage...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:19.32,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,There's a lot of amazing places, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.70,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it sounds dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:25.79,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll get \Nstrong and protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was really shy back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:32.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'd envisioned you swinging a wooden \Nsword and practicing every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That would’ve been Jinlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,She dragged me all around the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:44.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We got one heck of a scolding \Nfrom Granny later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:48.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But looking back, it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We were attacked on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,By him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.92,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:06.12,Flashback,Mom,0,0,0,,Get away from here, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:09.27,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Granny! Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:23.69,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:32.20,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Maybe it was an awful thing \Nto do, leaving them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:35.93,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But we were sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,...that we were the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.74,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,It has to have given up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:55.62,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's a horrible thought, looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:21.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The wolf monster was toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.69,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Jinlin! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:43.73,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,'cause I promised... I'd protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:50.69,Flashback,Jinlin,0,0,0,,Get stronger, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.29,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.69,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I'll handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.40,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,You still want a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.29,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:01.50,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:06.84,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:10.72,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.73,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,If I'd only gotten here sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:23.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,After he drove the wolf off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:28.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,the adventurer carried everyone's \Nbodies back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.78,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:38.36,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:43.68,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,How can I become an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:46.06,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:49.45,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,My friend wanted to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:51.20,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:53.63,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:58.13,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Rentt, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:00.49,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:05.40,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you need to be 15 to \Nregister with the Adventurers Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:12.12,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,So train hard in this village \Nfor the next ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.73,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,First, you need to learn to fight well enough to battle a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:19.20,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,And knowledge, you'll need that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:21.90,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Learn to read, write, and do arithmetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:27.07,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Herbs, magic, and how to survive \Nwhen you're in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:31.01,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,There must be hunters and old \Nherbalists in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:34.64,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,First, start by persuading \Nthem to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:36.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:41.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Most grown-ups would just say, "Good luck!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:48.05,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,And if I do all that, can \NI be a strong adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.26,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:54.82,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Knowledge and combat skill will \Nonly get you to the starting line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.84,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,After that, it's up to how \Nmuch effort you put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:00.67,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.57,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Remember one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:07.31,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,My name is Wilfried Ryukker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:09.31,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,A Mythril-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.07,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Mythril...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:15.81,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,When you become an adventurer, come see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:19.02,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,I don't know where I'll be \Nin a decade, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.67,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,But as long as I'm alive, I'll \Nprobably be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:30.06,Flashback,Wilfried,0,0,0,,Listen. Don't die until you \Nmake your dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:30.92,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.16,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:39.41,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It happens a lot, way \Nout in the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:42.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So the "certain person" you \Nmentioned long ago, was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:45.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes, that adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:48.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't know if you have \Ngood luck or bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:51.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The odds of randomly being saved \Nby a Mythril-class adventurer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:54.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,are about the same as the odds \Nof encountering a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:12:01.08,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So you learned your kindness from him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:06.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sure he was a nice guy, \Nbut he must've understood...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:08.59,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Understood what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:14.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Without a goal, I wasn't going \Nto get back my will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.82,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:20.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So that's why he made his advice \Nas specific as he could, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:28.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Someday I'll defeat the monster \Nthat killed my parents and Jinlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:32.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,After I become a Mythril-class \Nadventurer, like Wilfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:36.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A decade in the village, a decade in Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.72,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You've spent 20 years at this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:40.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And never got above Bronze, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.24,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm scared to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:46.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.41,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you give up, you're as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:54.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I knew you were only \Npretending to be uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:57.06,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, that's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:13:00.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll give your \Nbones a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:03.61,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's about all I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:04.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:09.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If something happens to me and \NI lose control, burn me to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.31,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm praying that won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:41.68,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm fine, at least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Looks like the blood was fake...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, Rentt! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.64,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Keep control of yourself, Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:16.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,What is this sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:21.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's like my body is being remade...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.58,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:28.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't want to become \None of those monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:29.27,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:30.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:31.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:38.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You have a dream... a goal, dont you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:42.94,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:45.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:15.58,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be worth a damn \Nwithout orichalcum, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:22.10,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,You don't have to start this early, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:25.80,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Oh, it's for him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:29.25,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,But didn't you just give him a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:38.24,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,I can't tell, but he's gotten \Na lot stronger, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:40.82,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.45,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,He's even picked up some weird tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.87,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Then we need to make \Nhim a worthy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.22,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,I have been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.62,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Hey, let me be an adventurer, next!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.23,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,I'll be the wizard, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.62,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,What? I'm the monster again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:06.12,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Oh my. Such a brave knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:08.91,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Or an adventurer, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:12.49,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,You need to be in bed, Headmistress Lilian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:14.01,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:16.03,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I feel wonderful today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:20.11,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,May I eat with you all today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.11,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.54,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Everyone will be overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.85,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Thank you, Alize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:32.51,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you that \NI'm doing better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.98,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,That's not true, Headmistress Lilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:40.50,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Everyone... everyone helped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:46.09,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.35,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm first here again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:50.26,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.61,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.79,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.51,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:00.07,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:03.00,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,We have a whole bunch of new jobs today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:06.26,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,It was worth coming early!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.47,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's go, Rina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:12.18,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Anything good, Ryze?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:15.64,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I still can't read some of these \Nletters, but how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.12,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,The pay's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:20.20,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,No way! It says it's the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:24.24,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,That's right. Only take jobs that \Nare a good fit for your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.11,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:29.31,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Hmm... seems good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:29.70,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:33.08,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful if you're \Ngoing to the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.77,0:17:37.73,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's important to turn back if \Neven the slightest thing feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:39.63,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.85,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,An adventurer must never \Nlet their guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:42.79,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:46.55,Main,Rina,0,0,0,,And... you only get one shot at life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:57.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want a little more sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:04.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've felt sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:08.22,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ever since I became an undead,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:11.13,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,it was like my whole body was \Nempty, down to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:18.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But with each evolution,\NI gained organs... skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:21.40,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That horrible feeling... the pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:27.25,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The fear and despair at becoming \Nsomething that wasn't me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:35.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess I only endured it \Nbecause I was immortal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:51.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:55.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I was reading a book about vampire ecology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:19:00.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Ghast. Lesser vampire. Middle. Greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:04.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The more powerful they become, \Nthe rarer it is to see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And the harder it becomes to classify them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:09.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why are you reading that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.72,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's an easy question to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:12.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:16.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:25.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What did I become?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll check for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Start by taking off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:36.18,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.28,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can shrink them by \Nfocusing on them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.30,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I never would've been able \Nto go out in public again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:53.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, so what did I become?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:58.31,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But whatever it is, it's \Na more powerful being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:01.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I assume it's one of the \Nweaker types of vampires,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:03.52,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,but I've never heard of one with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:04.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.97,0:20:07.45,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll look into the wings later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.16,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Start by showing me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:10.30,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:17.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see small fangs...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You're very likely a vampire, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Your eyes are red.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.88,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's something vampires\Nare well known for,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,but there are also humans with red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:40.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,On its own, that's not enough \Nfor you to be found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:43.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:48.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It feels like a face I haven't \Nseen in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:52.95,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I know it's late, but there's something \NI want to say to that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:56.28,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.48,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Rentt Faina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:08.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:10.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:37.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Sorry to drag you out here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:40.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's my thanks for \Neverything you've done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, did you ever go see Wilfried?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:49.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I looked for him a bunch, but he's \Nnot in this country, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:52.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Another country, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:56.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it's dangerous for a Bronze-class \Nto go on long journeys alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:57.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:23:03.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And part of me didn't want to go until \NI felt a bit more worthy, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:08.77,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And that's why you haven't \Ngone to see him for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.77,0:23:10.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:12.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:17.04,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But right now, I could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:19.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I could go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:27.11,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:30.39,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You don't listen to a word I say, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:33.10,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You'll get a chance sometime, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:34.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind coming along\Nif I'm not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:38.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
